meta {
  name: Best Buy
}

docs {
  # Best Buy Products API

  API documentation: https://developer.bestbuy.com/documentation/products-api

  ## Authentication

  Best Buy API uses an API key passed as a query parameter (`apiKey`).

  Get your API key at: https://developer.bestbuy.com/

  ## Rate Limits

  - 5 queries per second
  - 50,000 queries per day (for free tier)

  ## Base URL

  `https://api.bestbuy.com`
}
